original & $a\cdot 10000 + b$ & $36$ & $4.6006$ & $2.1314$ \\
clean re-implementation & width-valid & $36$ & $4.6006$ & $2.1314$ \\
rebuild & $\cdot 10$ inside $\cdot 100$ & $18$ & $3.6073$ & $0.5830$ \\
